title: v6.0.0 — breaking final cut (multi-tenant University + lore consolidation + legacy removal)
summary: v6.0.0 shipped. Same-day major-version follow-up to v5.39.0's additive bridge — all deferred breaking items landed cleanly. LoreType.decision hard-removed across 4 sites with structured rejection envelope (lore + assessment + storage layer), v1→v2 migration shim with `v6-migrated:from-decision` tag for forensic discovery, loadPortalConfigLegacy clean delete (security-cleared as never-on-public-API), PLSAT finalization via migrate-plsat --delete-sources with orphan .purpose cleanup (Jinx mitigation), regression harness shifted to graceful-skip mode for forward compatibility, server route headers refreshed. Wisdom type='decision' deliberately stays soft per D3 locked asymmetric justification + unanimous team agreement. Skip-upgrade safety verified (v5.37.11 → v6.0 still fail-closes). Lore criticality treated with extra rigor per user feedback — Bundle A got dedicated reviewer pass before chaining bundles B/C/D/E.
